Configure line of shared/, as recorded in its libavutil (avutil_configuration()).

  --prefix=/windows_amd64 --extra-cflags=-fPIC --enable-pic --disable-autodetect --disable-programs --disable-doc --disable-debug --disable-encoders --disable-muxers --disable-avfilter --enable-swscale --enable-swresample --enable-network --arch=x86_64 --target-os=mingw32 --enable-cross-compile --cross-prefix=x86_64-w64-mingw32- --enable-schannel --enable-avdevice --disable-indevs --enable-indev=dshow --enable-libdav1d --pkg-config=pkg-config --pkg-config-flags=--static --enable-shared --disable-static --build-suffix=-goffmpeg --extra-ldsoflags=-static-libgcc

Configure line of shared-audio/, as recorded in its libavutil.

  --prefix=/windows_amd64 --extra-cflags=-fPIC --enable-pic --disable-autodetect --disable-programs --disable-doc --disable-debug --disable-encoders --disable-muxers --disable-avfilter --enable-swscale --enable-swresample --enable-network --arch=x86_64 --target-os=mingw32 --enable-cross-compile --cross-prefix=x86_64-w64-mingw32- --enable-schannel --enable-avdevice --disable-decoders --disable-demuxers --disable-parsers --disable-bsfs --disable-hwaccels --disable-indevs --enable-demuxer='mp3,wav,ogg' --enable-decoder='mp3float,pcm_s16le,pcm_s24le,pcm_s32le,pcm_f32le,pcm_f64le,pcm_u8,opus' --enable-parser='mpegaudio,opus' --disable-swscale --disable-avdevice --disable-videotoolbox --enable-shared --disable-static --build-suffix=-goffmpeg-audio --extra-ldsoflags=-static-libgcc

Corresponding source:
  FFmpeg:  https://github.com/belluikit/ffmpeg/tree/goffmpeg-e2bc6d88cd
           belluikit's mirror of FFmpeg. The tag is commit
           e2bc6d88cd68184288c16570e04881c3a426a05a and stays for as long as
           libraries built from it are published.
  dav1d:   https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d/-/tree/1.5.2 (commit
           c720f4d3556a01916324aea155555d3efba842e8), built by goffmpeg's
           scripts/build-dav1d.sh.
  Build:   https://github.com/belluikit/goffmpeg (Makefile, BUILDING.md), which
           pins those revisions and these configure lines.
  Bridge:  lib/libgoffmpeg.* is goffmpeg's bridge.c (BSD-3-Clause), built by
           goffmpeg's 'make bridge-shared'. It holds no FFmpeg code: it loads
           the media set's DLLs in shared/, which must be beside the executable
           or on PATH.
           The current lib/libgoffmpeg.* was built from goffmpeg commit
           9db5aa3 by GitHub Actions run 43291848546.
  Shared:  shared/ and shared-audio/ were built by goffmpeg's 'make dist'
           (SET=media and SET=audio) from goffmpeg commit 9db5aa3 by GitHub
           Actions run 43291848546.
